### What can be done with a file.

## The menu of a file, in any list that shows one.

file-actions-history = File history
file-actions-blame = Blame
file-actions-blame-at = Blame as of this commit
file-actions-blame-before = Blame as it was before this commit
file-actions-diff-tool = Open in diff tool
file-actions-edit = Open in editor
file-actions-open-default = Open with default app
file-actions-edit-at = Open as of this commit
file-actions-edit-now = Open the file as it is now
file-actions-edit-before = Open as it was before this commit
file-actions-reveal = Show in file manager
file-actions-copy-path = Copy path
file-actions-restore = Restore this version
file-actions-restore-before = Restore as it was before

## For the place a file was moved from. $name is the file's name there, $old_path its whole path.

file-actions-old-edit = Open { $name } as it was before the move
file-actions-old-history = History of { $old_path }
file-actions-old-blame = Blame { $name } before the move
